 2.  **Clip $M_A$ against $M_B$'s BSP:**
-    a. Construct a BSP tree from the polygons of $M_B$.
-    b. Clip the polygon set of $M_A$ against this BSP tree.
-    c. Retain only polygons strictly greater than the BSP planes [G].
